{"availability":"available","full":"honua-io/honua-sdk-js","name":"honua-sdk-js","description":"TypeScript geospatial SDK: one protocol-neutral contract over Esri GeoServices, OGC API, STAC, WMS/WMTS/WFS, and OData — MapLibre-first runtime, ArcGIS widget-migration codemod, and a platform-free MCP server.","category":"Developer tools","language":"TypeScript","stars":2,"forks":1,"created":"2026-03-03T15:37:52Z","updated":"2026-10-04T08:13:44Z","license":"Apache-2.0","branch":"trunk","homepage":null,"topics":["arcgis","esri","geojson","geospatial","gis","honua","javascript","maplibre","mcp","migration","npm","odata","ogc-api","react","sdk","stac","typescript","wfs"],"demo":"https://honua-io.github.io/honua-sdk-js/gallery.html","color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-04T08:15:46.342Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-04T08:15:46.342Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-04T08:15:46.342Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-04T08:15:46.342Z","stars":2,"forks":1}],"technologies":["React"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["MapLibre renders the map. Honua connects, queries, explains, and mounts the data.","@honua/sdk-js is the integration layer for the open map stack: typed clients for the protocols your data already speaks (Esri GeoServices, OGC API Features / Tiles / Maps / Processes, STAC, WMS, WMTS, WFS 2.0, OData v4), a one-call data→map bridge and MapLibre runtime, provider-pluggable geocoding and routing, and a drop-in ArcGIS compatibility layer with a codemod. MapLibre is the stable renderer path; the optional Cesium scene surface is beta on @honua/app-platform, and Kepler.gl integration is experimental.","The versioned SDK sample catalog tracks all 34 executable examples: 4 qualified golden samples, 13 recipes, 14 labs, and 3 fixtures. Seven journey IDs are reserved; 3 remain explicitly planned candidates. The catalog is the source of truth for track, support, lifecycle, fixture/live evidence, quality profiles, and the honua.io projection."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/honua-io/honua-sdk-js/blob/trunk/README.md","fingerprint":"691c3258ccf2b9df146b115b9e63133250ab93e168a96ba0d6ef5fc939bd4fac","extractedAt":"2026-10-04T08:15:46.494Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-04T08:15:46.494Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"MapLibre renders the map. Honua connects, queries, explains, and mounts the data.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/honua-io/honua-sdk-js/blob/trunk/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"documented","text":"No Honua server, no API key, no account — one lifecycle owner takes a public Esri Living Atlas FeatureServer through inspection, a bounded query, an explainable plan, and a styled MapLibre map.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/honua-io/honua-sdk-js/blob/trunk/README.md"},{"kind":"account","status":"documented","text":"This runs against a public Esri GeoServices endpoint — no API key, no account, no infrastructure — and walks the kernel's verbs in order: connect → query → explain (the fourth verb, mount, is the hero at the top of this page).","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/honua-io/honua-sdk-js/blob/trunk/README.md"},{"kind":"api_key","status":"required","text":"Authentication resolves from --api-key, HONUAAPIKEY, or a saved honua login.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/honua-io/honua-sdk-js/blob/trunk/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"691c3258ccf2b9df146b115b9e63133250ab93e168a96ba0d6ef5fc939bd4fac","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/honua-io/honua-sdk-js/blob/trunk/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-04T08:15:46.494Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-04T08:13:44Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/honua-io/honua-sdk-js/blob/trunk/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-04T08:15:46.497Z","hash":"691c3258ccf2b9df146b115b9e63133250ab93e168a96ba0d6ef5fc939bd4fac","originalBytes":48338,"storedBytes":48338,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["docs","honua","sdk-js","run","npm","sdk","generated","server","every","query",